ect=1 add_direct=1`).\n- **`compute_checksum` reads the raw object representation** via `copy_nonoverlapping`, so it stays byte-order-dependent like the original; the uninitialized-buffer tail is never read in either version.\n\n`cargo build --release` succeeds from clean with **0 warnings**.","ttft_ms":3426,"ttft_stream_ms":3276,"time_to_request_ms":36,"type":"result","duration_ms":368220,"uuid":"dd05cdb8-2a25-4139-b878-ed075751ebc6"}
